    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>Hack-A-Throne is a national-level hackathon where students, developers, designers, and innovators come together to turn their ideas into impactful technology solutions.</p>\n<p>Participants will choose a domain, identify a real-world problem within that domain, and build their own innovative solution.</p>\n<p><strong>Domains:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>AI &amp; Intelligent Systems</li>\n<li>FinTech &amp; Digital Economy</li>\n<li>HealthTech &amp; Wellbeing</li>\n<li>Sustainability &amp; Smart Cities</li>\n<li>EdTech &amp; Future of Learning</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Hackathon Structure:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Round 1 &mdash; Idea Submission:</strong></p>\n<p>Participants will submit their idea, selected domain, problem they aim to solve, proposed solution, and other required team details through the official submission form.</p>\n<p><strong>Round 2 &mdash; Final Submission:</strong></p>\n<p>Shortlisted teams will submit:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GitHub repository link</li>\n<li>Live project/website link</li>\n<li>Demo video link via Google Drive</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Projects will be evaluated based on innovation, technical implementation, usability, real-world impact, and scalability.</p>\n<p><strong>Team Size:</strong> 2&ndash;4 Members<br /><strong>Prize Pool:</strong> ₹15,000+<br /><strong>Event Date:</strong> 25th October 2026<br /><strong>WhatsApp Group Link:</strong> <a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/KdkyXqEuPlT2XqpIlxP73h\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/KdkyXqEuPlT2XqpIlxP73h</a></p>\n<p>Come with an idea. Build it. Claim the Throne.</p>\n<p>BUILD &bull; INNOVATE &bull; CONQUER.</p>",
